{"game": "earth-defense-force-5", "language": "english", "appid": 1007040, "month": "2021-05", "window": 4, "start_date": 1621814400, "end_date": 1622505599, "month_true_total": 125, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-28 17:50:21 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "92958597", "author": {"steamid": "76561198353732586", "personaname": "Habahdeedabah", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198353732586/", "num_games_owned": 90, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 8954, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2547, "last_played": 1771469667, "avatar": "5b8825b34c5d77b00c3a18897f2f1175fa0e0e57"}, "language": "english", "review": "I bought this game because I had seen some videos and it looked like completely insane fun, and it absolutely delivers. I beat the campaign once in my first 40 hours of playing and just got a 15% completion achievement, there's so much content and I have no idea when it'll ever get old. Absolutely recommend for anyone looking for an engaging and entirely fun experience.", "timestamp_created": 1622497662, "timestamp_updated": 1622497662, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "92950686", "author": {"steamid": "76561197997794268", "personaname": "Tricksy One", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197997794268/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 3925, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3585, "last_played": 1622952106, "avatar": "921650eebe3bd18a193162e3c11107b58049e39d"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is over-the-top and goofy, but in the best way. However, I only recommend playing this if you have at least 1 or 2 friends to play it with. The early missions are fine, but the AI is pretty useless against the enemies and you will need friends to get through it.", "timestamp_created": 1622487559, "timestamp_updated": 1622487559, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "92838951", "author": {"steamid": "76561198360626143", "personaname": "Bing Bong's Bounty Bazinga", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/-Osu-/", "num_games_owned": 174, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 2966, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1090, "last_played": 1663298754, "avatar": "931bef657ba4f41b991da2cef0d034b6f55081da"}, "language": "english", "review": "Air Raider go BOOM", "timestamp_created": 1622343952, "timestamp_updated": 1622343952, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "92833775", "author": {"steamid": "76561198144769087", "personaname": "Hornet", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/formerly_chuck/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 323, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 210, "last_played": 1623815072, "avatar": "7e5eb3f3edaf0ab131a489fd1250d25b47ef0872"}, "language": "english", "review": "EDF! EDF!! EDF!!!", "timestamp_created": 1622336392, "timestamp_updated": 1622336392, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "92827566", "author": {"steamid": "76561198065455631", "personaname": "Voldar", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/wizzardice/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 56, "playtime_forever": 1994, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 218, "last_played": 1721534150, "avatar": "04d62ad548deae5633da0eb4d1343329cb83fd6e"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's pretty rare, these days, to find a game that is just plain fun. That's what this is. \n\nThe overall feel is reminiscent of the original Ultraman TV show, complete with the cheesy English dubs that are so bad you can't help but like them.\n\nThe gameplay is top-notch. Lots of nuance in the player archetypes and lots of fun weapons to blast alien monsters into tiny pieces with. Couple this with the over-the-top ridiculousness of the battles and you got yourself something very fine indeed.", "timestamp_created": 1622326923, "timestamp_updated": 1622326923, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}]}